message: "If you use this work, please cite the paper concerned and this repository."
title: "Lattice Yang–Mills theory: papers and Lean 4 formalisations"
abstract: "Twelve papers on four-dimensional SU(2) lattice gauge theory and on related model problems, with the Lean 4 developments that check their machine-checked statements. No continuum limit and no mass gap of four-dimensional Yang–Mills theory is claimed."
authors:
